ing, and plenty of room to gather. A 2 pc bath, garage access, and back deck overlooking the courtyard complete the main floor. Upstairs are 3 bedrooms, including a spacious primary with walk-in closet and 4 pc ensuite, plus a full main bath and laundry. The fully finished basement adds valuable rec space with room for movie nights, a play area, home gym, or office. Extras include A/C, blinds, an attached garage, and a location near transit, the rec centre, and amenities.This complex offers exceptional management too! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$395,000"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,673 sq ft"],["Lot size","2,560 sq ft"],["Year built","2000"],["Storeys","2"],["Condo fee","$374 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Leger"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6R2Y9"],["MLS® number","E4510317"],["Listed","September 25, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.89 m × 4.92 m (12'9\" × 16'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.83 m × 3.18 m (12'7\" × 10'5\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.71 m × 3.64 m (8'11\" × 11'11\")"],["Family room","Basement","5.82 m × 7.64 m (19'1\" × 25'1\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.54 m × 3.65 m (14'11\" × 12'0\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","3.95 m × 4.46 m (13'0\" × 14'8\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.73 m × 4.07 m (8'11\" × 13'4\")"],["Breakfast","Main level","2.72 m × 2.94 m (8'11\" × 9'8\")"],["Laundry room","Upper Level","2.20 m × 2.27 m (7'3\" × 7'5\")"]],"courtesy":"Nicole Bosse, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"leger","area":"sou